1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Twelve psychology facts you will start noticing today. Watch this carefully.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
First: we judge faces in a split second, before logic even begins.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Second: gossip bonds groups very fast, because shared secrets create trust.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Third: unfinished tasks stay in your head. Your brain keeps asking for closure.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Fourth: posture changes confidence instantly. Stand taller, and your tone changes too.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Fifth: holding hands lowers stress. The body reads safety through connection.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Sixth: music can shift your mood. A few notes can reset your state.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Seventh: your name grabs attention fast. It feels personal to the listener.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Silence, mirroring, scarcity, and endings shape memory far more than we expect.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Finally: your mind protects beliefs first, and truth second. Watch your reactions this week.
